  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49fbf78ed5dc14c5ae08299a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……\n身体好像没法如愿行动的样子…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "67134729d24c1de3604e9a2fe8a00bead9e02cce9d3d7dddf376a375fef43d1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c1f7adf51d2bdc1db99e4cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了各位粉丝，\n明明必须要努力才行……\n飞鹰子的干劲都去哪儿了呢～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "99fb5fd7d9f93181fc6676731d95728e5b888e11df35011435f37d51010dafe9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fb9aa72659a8e9e61d3f34e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈……今天可能已经到极限了……\n就算是马娘偶像也有无能为力的时候啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d27a13d27588afec6c66be2c7a80ed2e256a7a29c8dd92430b3dfe8efc4f0895",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff2afb682bf70b4b53c0c194",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又要跑比赛吗？\n果然训练员也对飞鹰子寄以厚望吧…？\n唔嗯～不过，比赛实在太频繁啦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbd9fae274f10d6d03fa42db72016451bcca4fce13d5381256211394f4489692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63a2cd5fdab76f9c646804c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶诶，这不是成天都在跑比赛了嘛？\n虽然比赛也确实很重要啦……\n但是但是，对马娘偶像而言，休息也很重要哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef7e8e917bfff20823f15dcb9fb24b12d2eb489415d47b2791b8dd8ee64266b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:995794a4b22645634c1812c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于可以拿出真正的实力了呢！\n最强马娘偶像、醒目飞鹰！\n要闪闪发光地上了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfda5738a5be7ae9195969af1c788f1c789832b622db58652630ed17e470456b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4995d14a1c4c2470e8cd6a55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，你做好准备了吗？\n飞鹰子已经做好了哦☆\n希望我的笑容也能传递给大家呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b99c25a719374dbf200b256874158d6794f311691d68ae7e78e24b4cce598ccc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6919cdad9ac5ed2cbc3da5f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "彩排也好好做过了，\n现在的飞鹰子可是无所畏惧哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "30e60485b7dfcbb0873cdd05baf895a0aca4e122187c9a3a887cbeb2a31a523e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d69d7cd245dd2327a8880e02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可是好好训练过的，\n不用担心啦。\n只需要好好注视着飞鹰子的活跃就好了哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "914b9574e0da9bab557f1d2087a84d1448987c74527650f74928dd3335c66a62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:249b127bd3696989dd6de960",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有问题，一切OK哦☆\n毕竟我也是马娘偶像嘛，\n为了正赛而做好调整可是理所当然的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "740db479d57aeec9b02d7aa41c6a05701654244748f8fb62468639d168337f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:217bdd85a2aa7d3d277cb4bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸嘿嘿，现在感觉状态不错哦☆\n保持这个状态的话，\n比赛也一定能获胜的吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f6b91df9872b0ae1aa12a5b6cd1e4e9b43013eb3c72f335ffe51c6427f593c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20d67f5baf0953af988d6c96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的观众很多吗？\n越来越期待了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dff160902f5342ce53e22a3cec19cc9b8dfbb13e2a2b0641078ab8da41a4353",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5e8f7f465e74ee9da65edbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标比赛……\n这也是成为马娘偶像的重要一步呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "10798a5568da1d1bb77a0c07ff7c110452a8af652a10a96b6e4effa4ad82ea7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dbd5373dccc5a3f5c512af8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发型OK，笑容满分！\n我会一如既往地加油的哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "181ec292c6814a239ba5c3c1bc7142b0e85f1d5a22de17a6c45a78420410ea1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ba619c6a0b106502c2c58ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯……虽然有点不安，但没关系的！\n作为马娘偶像，\n就是应该化危机为机会呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6a23676ab03d901f960aaf5d3d2eaace1fc8706f6781de4620ad3f8a11aa8c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23e16a3e923761e04622e92c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力是不会骗人的！\n飞鹰子，抬起头来！\n继续努力向前！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3f4d167309b655d215236d6280fde8af2fc15d266eef591be2f469f16e83731",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90d40dfd54c16a235297b258",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要时刻面带微笑的话，\n无论怎样的高墙都能跨越！\n飞鹰子，Fight——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9311f948fba60b86f10114fd95428a3c6d311ff3f654e7f77ce3e8126baca17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faee8849b953db05f07bf962",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么办才好啊……\n飞鹰子，有点不安呢……\n训练员，一定要为我加油哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8db208ff35e1d15df3a084595ccf34ec33581b13b2ec32576579a08b45a1d683",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:184c36a6f3d1dc69341fd986",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也能绽放光辉吗……\n为了不让大家失望，\n飞鹰子也要全力以赴…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cff69f13f966f7f12e68eca7dd4ad9e35f31af34c707fbc511d970878534f691",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aa653aa9d7b83c162f8a836",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没关系的……没关系的！\n飞鹰子可是马娘偶像……\n必须要将笑容传递给大家才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "abaab9fda02b26822c7ac67a75915b1606644c0407757b1dfba2852a0082aa7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
