        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23ddd04e3a4cd98d998537df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "马娘偶像传说势不可挡！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e1c539e3975f9520d059e918a3d3ea410a4ccb25c0f61cbdc0ec1a971661f0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:657f3e4b47b6199902cb6238",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家——！谢谢你们的支持☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "331065883ba90315d7663cdbfd90f7bee3cdcdccce35dd37b5fc1bef82e7a00e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a12a411a5d6f9b560d8bc231",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了庆祝胜利——\r\n飞鹰子进行曲，Start♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "19452b536faba61f75956e5e42db6fa0964abd3e2058a73a9f52760888ceb79e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e689f56b9d9a9f0d372574a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家——！谢谢你们的支持☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "331065883ba90315d7663cdbfd90f7bee3cdcdccce35dd37b5fc1bef82e7a00e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6f526c72795599d18aa1c58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要支持飞鹰子哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9952585b2f227d73e489f3e0fd8b3fd76b4651e1deef480d4f86defd0eb6363",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd8d432587291585bf1ba822",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这最棒的瞬间，一定得传递给大家才行☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e99922166f311335b4f61b8cf42d5b11a1a0ec56b035bd24def5d1186bb828b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f008d7de6862fcc19da5b09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "招募成员、选歌、编舞♪有趣的事好多☆\r\n但预算文件～……噗咻咻咻咻～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83907fd9ffa42ce236d49dbd686c367c0ea948401fb7cc6fbc0d9437692a6411",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10b7eea9ed648d2e846b7a3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然想给闪耀看看日本的海滩，\r\n但工作得利索完成！这就是偶像☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "49c9f9616057793938730f5c9a70acc90f508e2a255e15a00a5b0de91c1cf690",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:822e07605bb69280c7a5b910",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好怀念啊，和留学生同寝室我也很紧张！\r\n现在简直像空气？必不可少的那种♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b28d2412e32c185af964ab0b495ae96710878f1e0f4b1ca745ac32310d86365",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcd077eb2f39cafa837dd931",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让大家久等啦！☆\n飞鹰子来了哦～☆\n谢谢、谢谢大家！那么……要上了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c4b9c72d2a5239a481e29821c4f1d8c00a07081194c557f492e3f99a660ce1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d62f1245e9d220bdc1af3faa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是一场精彩的Live♪北港火山好可爱～♡\r\n那绝对值得推！超值得！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ece0bfceb6caccad57986e7198b3379909a699794c7bc7f7b5ab7b823e69100",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dbd4c12810a64b0b6c79469",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光芒还在闪烁……像在呼唤我们！\r\n闭幕式后再来个安可Live怎么样☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f163b1ed64401679384c271f963cac1f1f28c2510d122a82ece88835a5f50604",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b5a24095a47ffd6ec7324bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不准偷看别人哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f935ba88155c93593e879a47f8e97e1b4afec457307bb4eca4a46e34d8a939e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:261186af8d6bdabcfaab92bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只许你注视着飞鹰子噢♪\r\n飞鹰子会比任何人都更强、更可爱、更耀眼的哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "896df7c13db9f07192e88647433b7fddab9a90e2aa6df834c62cf7116913f94a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0b1155e47607b787d607986",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不会浪费的☆大家都在努力练习嘛。\r\n而且……我也想展示我的舞步♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f21dacff2ae2e4b8b194b2d83c56028b5bc1748283b7f7a8744fa4bd9105bbd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "400111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3911a80806658fe0269fd85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟上飞鹰子的节奏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3681f299e9233d73af18bade90a0320f5525f57ca7fb0bfbbac449ffe8d9dc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6828e0a8e743307bd774b4d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家和飞鹰子一起！\r\n为粉丝们送去梦想和希望吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a36d5f5ed80baffab4cc97805d25068d6cbc5a09cb22957feb2bdd54ed98c0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e43e74d97d6654687017d88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要和各位粉丝一起绽放光芒了哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae60a4d9fa1a481d02e428eaa87e91f171458e9ffdbc2dd7bf8c98f77549f682",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf90f22736573a13da9d5412",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～啊～♪今天的飞鹰子也状态绝佳☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0598c88633c245ef779281b73e54bec887619c9f58927a426aaa5c05729b6f44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7a2437632331819b4fab568",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和飞鹰子一起为了可爱而努力吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e129a74dffcc76016a3dd25c5d5295273c9186c1f9acd959722c97e13f8cb13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b2964a2034276da1c341fd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员成为飞鹰子的粉丝的那天，\n飞鹰子永远都不会忘记哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "3add4aecbad4df74b97321061cc1938a35754d29f2cace03c933ef584adf2649",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2d4443d0f7a63cfde2df22d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对于马娘偶像而言，\n制服是必须的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d7b159ca211fc831c0aa3deeef40c9217a172021b9d16c849c855efe210c150",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec0728a961db9484cf8ec12e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻飘飘的衣服，很可爱呢～！\n和飞鹰子很搭哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a49747e7a8dc925bf5795968ce9918d880e108709b1a2d19e1bb090e7468c706",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aacc09adeb63aee54ee77a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又可爱又健康的设计，\n这就是马娘偶像应有的感觉呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78985613ea0ef77aaf94ef091f0d019925e2e582cd5e23fc7cb51f1f48bea094",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47bb0801856da19718b2952a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么啦怎么啦？制服没有皱巴巴的吧？\n身为马娘偶像，可得随时注意仪容呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33b2accf0d7f18d4e19dfc3722585e2089319b23149be708cd211e1883cdf38d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:240756086b2090930e272a79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定要好好上舞蹈课，\n就算是C位也不能怯场呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "496f6bd3be8860f4eec2beddf109e8c3d06b46e77e129983e1a086e214628483",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcdd8c648b0b3b05c2004b5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎嘿嘿……一见钟情了嘛？\n这是独属于飞鹰子的衣服哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b2e30ed97901c62b26f41b2899bfc8254c7029754188a35730593beebd04b13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f97669ec7d3bbd4b078faf0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噔噔噔☆\r\n如何？飞鹰子也有帅气的一面哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "766518c8aa52a40cb10c7a0125c5399606ed8fe6e9c6f57116e5c37e04e75c41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64806b12ab3389c517aa9846",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便满身泥泞，\r\n这份光辉也绝不会被掩盖！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f523e9ec9eeee6b93a13fba7d476afd3e11d1394685f6f6c0497e6ad961be13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45d32f304e7af93c8cbae5ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子超可爱的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4ae35e2d57eb815245272c28d195fde24c726fb992bfbe0ffd86298d29e8661",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afdda5b50247c30731d3ae68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我才不会让出C位哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cb9719ebd909c319a747ea2f9200ebd2e8fecd7e8a68183102cf094a30b6ddf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bea87975804490a1d166124",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休假我也不会松懈的。\r\n因为我可是赛马娘偶像嘛☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2e7026bfe85c358dc2b00f590dea30c07eb9b0dc91ef299dd2274a21b2238c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6bce708434c1a1960f76ed5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要去看偶像的演唱会？\r\n兼具个人兴趣和调查目的☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "90734a628a143ca47273592fce1a4ff94305bdbc3058c47836d421b2bbbbcf02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcfab625a0620e03df17ac40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "带你前往令人心动的舞台哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7471c63d955c2ff8d02c38ae35dc089d28b5e5b8623a56b97ebc9303ff9fa1a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c52090964bff0a27cbd16ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很可爱的徽章吧？是我亲手做的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "41491e3a6198033c3520a0b14029d03d0b3e2bd07287a40cb0b810322d10c877",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "70217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11c3dea6dfb6f32a4e5254af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对于马娘偶像而言，\n制服是必须的呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d7b159ca211fc831c0aa3deeef40c9217a172021b9d16c849c855efe210c150",
